  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Given equation: 165 * 33 * 26 * 17 * 2 * 19 * 16\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) ÷, +, -, ×, +, =**\n\nGiven: 165 * 33 * 26 * 17 * 2 * 19 * 16\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**165 ÷ 33**__ + 26 - 17 × 2 + 19 = 16\n\n⇒ 5 + 26 - __**17 × 2**__ + 19 = 16\n\n⇒ __**5 + 26**__ - 34 __**+ 19**__ = 16\n\n⇒ __50 - 34__ = 16\n\n⇒ **16 = 16**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) ×, +, -, =, +, ÷\n\nGiven: 165 * 33 * 26 * 17 * 2 * 19 * 16\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**165 × 33**__ + 26 - 17 = 2 + __**19 ÷ 16**__\n\n⇒ __**5445 + 26**__ - 17 = __**2 + 1.1875**__\n\n⇒ __**5471 - 17**__ = 3.1875\n\n⇒ 5454 ≠ 3.1875\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) ÷, -, + ,-, ×, =\n\nGiven: 165 * 33 * 26 * 17 * 2 * 19 * 16\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**165 ÷ 33**__ - 26 + 17 - 2 × 19 = 16\n\n⇒ 5 - 26 + 17 - __**2 × 19**__ = 16\n\n⇒ __**5**__ - 26 __**+ 17**__ - 38 = 16\n\n⇒ __22** - 26 - 38**__ = 16\n\n⇒ -42 ≠ 16\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) ÷, +, =, +, -, ×\n\nGiven: 165 * 33 * 26 * 17 * 2 * 19 * 16\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**165 ÷ 33**__ + 26 = 17 + 2 - __**19 × 16**__\n\n⇒ __**5 + 26**__ = __**17 + 2**__ - 304\n\n⇒ 31 = __**19 - 304**__\n\n⇒ 31 ≠ -285\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
